  "description": "QOTSEB crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C58 H48 Dy6 K2 N12 O36,8(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.949-4.554 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.33-149.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C58H48Dy6K2N12O36·8(CH4O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
